    "description": "Sanyei Corporation engages in the wholesale and retail of furniture and houseware, fashion accessories, and home appliances in Japan and internationally. It operates through Furniture and Household Goods Business, Fashion Goods Business and Home Appliance Business segments. The company offers furniture and interior products, as well as housewares under the foxx chair and Formio brands; operates online furniture store under the MINT brand; operates garden exterior goods store under the Tsukuri brand; footwear under the BIRKENSTOCK, Orthofeet and BENEXY brands; and bags under the Kipling and uF brands. It also provides environment friendly products, including watches under the Our Earth Project and YOT WATCH brands; hair products under the mod's hair brand; and home appliances and cooking equipment under the Vitantonio and MULTI CHEF brands, as well as operates pet salons, hotels, veterinary hospitals, and pet-related products retail stores under the Pepica brand. In addition, the company offers services, such as shipping, fulfillment and product procurement under the Thirdlogi brand and retails emergency supplies through online platform under the BOUSAI DIRECT brand. The company was formerly known as SANYEI Boeki and changed its name to Sanyei Corporation in 1971. Sanyei Corporation was founded in 1946 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
